Timecrate — provenance and licence
https://github.com/spencernorton/timecrate

Origin
------
Original work, not a fork. It was developed alongside a fork of Timeshift
(https://github.com/linuxmint/timeshift) and shares no code with it; it is not
affiliated with Linux Mint. Releases before 3.0.0 were distributed as the
time-machine and time-machine-gui packages.

